WEBVTT

01:49.910 --> 01:54.930
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.990
[Episode 8]

01:59.150 --> 02:01.510
Before I can devise a plan,

02:01.540 --> 02:03.540
Song Yimeng has said so many things.

02:04.480 --> 02:06.840
Are she and Chu Guihong
causing a disturbance

02:06.840 --> 02:08.360
and trying to frame me for that,

02:08.360 --> 02:11.610
so Chu can score political points?

02:11.660 --> 02:12.610
Mr. Li,

02:13.430 --> 02:14.560
think about it.

02:15.120 --> 02:16.630
Nan Hang has done much evil

02:16.750 --> 02:18.350
over these years, hasn't he?

02:20.079 --> 02:21.200
If you're dreaded

02:21.360 --> 02:23.030
by his noble status

02:23.400 --> 02:25.190
and the thought of fighting him,

02:25.190 --> 02:27.310
I can have Chu Guihong join us.

02:28.360 --> 02:29.560
The three of us will take

02:29.560 --> 02:30.750
Nan Heng down together.

02:30.750 --> 02:31.560
No need.

02:32.150 --> 02:33.520
You are a daughter

02:33.520 --> 02:34.980
of an important official.

02:35.000 --> 02:37.280
Chu is a military officer
favored by the Emperor.

02:37.280 --> 02:38.079
By contrast,

02:38.870 --> 02:40.240
I'm just a nobody

02:40.240 --> 02:41.570
unworthy of attention.

02:42.910 --> 02:44.710
The Waning River Crescent can't

02:44.770 --> 02:46.320
afford to offend powerful figures.

02:46.320 --> 02:47.450
Don't worry.

02:47.480 --> 02:48.910
If anything happens,

02:48.940 --> 02:50.740
I'll take full responsibility.

02:51.130 --> 02:52.079
What's more,

02:52.079 --> 02:53.560
I assure you that Chu Guihong

02:53.560 --> 02:56.000
is a loyal and upstanding man.

03:00.580 --> 03:02.290
Yimeng trusts me.

03:02.440 --> 03:04.770
It is wrong of me to
ever suspect that she is

03:05.040 --> 03:06.440
involved with Li Shiliu.

03:09.590 --> 03:11.280
Chu Guihong is my fiancé.

03:11.630 --> 03:13.670
As long as you join us

03:13.750 --> 03:15.320
in this great cause,

03:15.430 --> 03:16.230
I promise

03:16.250 --> 03:17.660
he will keep you safe.

03:20.730 --> 03:22.490
He will keep me safe?

03:24.280 --> 03:25.720
Why do you trust him?

03:25.800 --> 03:27.130
Because I know him well.

03:27.920 --> 03:29.450
Just like me,

03:29.630 --> 03:31.540
he hates Nan Heng's guts.

03:32.000 --> 03:34.030
We won't let Nan Heng

03:34.050 --> 03:35.710
take one more life.

03:50.120 --> 03:51.710
Mr. Li, do you know about

03:51.710 --> 03:53.190
the autumn royal hunting

03:54.310 --> 03:55.840
that happened 19 years ago?

04:00.030 --> 04:01.470
You know something

04:02.150 --> 04:03.610
about that too, Miss Song?

04:04.030 --> 04:04.840
Yes,

04:05.630 --> 04:07.030
But that's not the point.

04:07.380 --> 04:08.600
The point is,

04:09.860 --> 04:11.580
the late Empress, Chu Yurong,

04:12.030 --> 04:13.720
died in an assassination

04:14.000 --> 04:16.600
related to Nan Heng.

04:22.320 --> 04:27.880
♪ I leave the book aside,
though I haven't finished reading it ♪

04:28.780 --> 04:30.640
[Young Nan Heng]

04:28.840 --> 04:30.900
This path doesn't lead to the palace.

04:31.010 --> 04:32.040
You lied!

04:31.260 --> 04:37.000
♪ I know one day I can have
a glimpse of the ending ♪

04:40.080 --> 04:44.200
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

04:40.650 --> 04:43.080
[Young Chu Guihong]

04:41.830 --> 04:43.620
She was Chu Guihong's aunt,

04:43.720 --> 04:45.190
who loved him most

04:45.140 --> 04:48.070
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

04:45.380 --> 04:47.040
after his mother's passing.

04:47.270 --> 04:48.950
He would hate to see anyone die

04:48.930 --> 04:53.530
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

04:48.950 --> 04:50.210
before his eyes again,

04:51.070 --> 04:52.310
so he started

04:52.480 --> 04:53.940
practicing martial arts.

04:54.030 --> 04:56.270
Neither the cold in winter
or the heat in summer

04:56.270 --> 04:58.000
could make him rest for one day.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.720
Years later,

05:00.430 --> 05:02.410
he became a guard for
the borders and the citizens.

05:02.410 --> 05:03.830
He was wounded numerous times

05:03.830 --> 05:05.290
and saw a lot of bloodshed.

05:05.860 --> 05:08.860
His life was endangered
on countless occasions.

05:09.800 --> 05:11.660
He never flinched simply because

05:12.360 --> 05:15.560
he made an oath before
the late Empress's memorial tablet

05:15.720 --> 05:16.950
at eight years old

05:16.380 --> 05:21.950
♪ People's demeanor varies
in this world of hustle and bustle ♪

05:17.270 --> 05:18.560
to study martial arts

05:18.560 --> 05:20.110
and to become strong by all means.

05:20.110 --> 05:21.440
He knows only in that way

05:21.480 --> 05:23.600
can he protect those he cares about

05:23.740 --> 05:26.020
and prevent innocent lives

05:25.430 --> 05:31.840
♪ Are they all bound by
destiny at the same time? ♪

05:26.070 --> 05:27.950
from being taken in his presence.

05:29.200 --> 05:30.950
But Nan Heng is different.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.270
Get in there!

05:33.390 --> 05:34.720
After causing the late Empress's death,

05:34.650 --> 05:38.510
♪ A simple move can lead to
multiple major changes ♪

05:34.750 --> 05:36.040
instead of pondering his mistake,

05:36.040 --> 05:36.920
he degenerated even more

05:36.920 --> 05:37.850
Eat it or starve!

05:38.360 --> 05:39.830
and turned into a heartless killer

05:39.190 --> 05:42.659
♪ Who can find out the truth? ♪

05:39.870 --> 05:41.240
of innocent people.

05:42.010 --> 05:44.870
The nation's wellbeing
means nothing to him.

05:43.360 --> 05:48.210
♪ Is it a bluff or a real match? ♪

05:45.470 --> 05:46.750
To gain more power,

05:46.820 --> 05:48.870
he even harmed an old friend.

05:50.240 --> 05:51.940
General Chu defended
the borders heroically.

05:51.630 --> 05:55.480
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

05:52.210 --> 05:55.040
But now he's trapped by a vile official.

05:55.500 --> 05:57.000
Colluding with the enemy

05:56.290 --> 05:59.400
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

05:57.070 --> 05:58.290
is unforgivable.

05:58.750 --> 06:00.010
He should be executed.

06:00.750 --> 06:07.230
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

06:00.830 --> 06:01.630
Yes.

06:02.630 --> 06:03.720
Mr. Li,

06:04.190 --> 06:06.760
despite your different origins
from Chu Guihong's,

06:06.760 --> 06:07.990
I can tell

06:08.630 --> 06:10.500
that deep down, both of you

06:09.790 --> 06:13.180
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

06:10.580 --> 06:12.390
are righteous men

06:12.560 --> 06:14.160
who share a sense of justice.

06:14.670 --> 06:17.860
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

06:15.790 --> 06:16.930
I know

06:17.240 --> 06:18.430
you treat Yunlong and Shanhu

06:18.430 --> 06:19.800
like your own brothers.

06:18.900 --> 06:25.120
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

06:20.160 --> 06:23.000
You would lend a helping
hand to innocent people.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.800
Isn't he the same?

06:26.560 --> 06:28.720
What a shame that his beloved aunt

06:28.740 --> 06:30.140
and father both left him.

06:30.990 --> 06:33.030
20 thousand of his fellow Qianyu soldiers

06:33.030 --> 06:34.570
all died on the battlefield.

06:34.570 --> 06:36.760
That brief four-word report, saying

06:37.000 --> 06:39.460
"Pingrong Battle is lost," can't summarize

06:39.480 --> 06:40.930
what he went through.

06:41.210 --> 06:42.870
He did everything in his capacity

06:42.870 --> 06:44.659
and even risked his life

06:44.920 --> 06:46.830
to clear the names
of those dead warriors.

06:46.830 --> 06:47.480
Mr. Li,

06:47.480 --> 06:49.159
isn't it enough to make you trust him?

06:49.159 --> 06:49.680
Stop it!

06:49.680 --> 06:50.310
I...

06:51.550 --> 06:52.620
Mr. Li,

06:53.630 --> 06:55.270
did I say anything wrong?

06:55.270 --> 06:56.270
Now I understand.

06:56.960 --> 06:58.530
In your heart,

06:58.870 --> 07:00.600
though Nan Heng and Chu Guihong

07:00.790 --> 07:02.040
are both military commanders

07:02.040 --> 07:03.640
and martial practitioners,

07:04.480 --> 07:06.180
the former harms people and strives

07:06.180 --> 07:07.560
for selfish gain, while the latter

07:07.560 --> 07:09.270
saves lives and devotes
himself to the country.

07:09.270 --> 07:11.070
-I...
-With all due respect,

07:11.090 --> 07:12.210
Miss Song,

07:12.390 --> 07:14.520
you're not a good partner to work with.

07:15.220 --> 07:16.160
Why?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.240
Because you are blinded by love

07:17.240 --> 07:19.240
and unable to tell right from wrong!

07:19.300 --> 07:21.270
Mr. Li, I'm not blinded by love.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.430
I'm not lovestruck at all.

07:22.430 --> 07:24.000
I mean, Chu Guihong is...

07:24.000 --> 07:25.610
He is not worthy of me

07:26.040 --> 07:27.160
putting myself through

07:27.160 --> 07:29.390
this life-threatening shenanigan with you.

07:29.390 --> 07:30.190
Goodbye.

07:30.720 --> 07:32.360
Mr. Li, what's the matter with you?

07:32.360 --> 07:34.100
I really need you now.

07:57.430 --> 07:59.270
Gosh. Two Li Shilius. How come?

08:03.500 --> 08:04.510
[Big Fortune]

08:08.240 --> 08:09.160
Li Shiliu?

08:09.250 --> 08:11.190
[Big Fortune]

08:14.120 --> 08:15.590
Why are there two Chiefs?

08:15.920 --> 08:17.190
Which one is real?

08:17.720 --> 08:18.660
This one.

08:18.800 --> 08:19.480
This one?

08:20.420 --> 08:21.300
That one.

08:21.580 --> 08:22.510
That one?

08:22.990 --> 08:24.990
Which one? I can't tell them apart.

08:44.270 --> 08:45.080
Shanhu!

08:45.840 --> 08:47.800
W-Which one is the real Li Shiliu?

08:48.960 --> 08:50.140
We can't tell either.

08:50.140 --> 08:52.290
Good heavens!

08:52.600 --> 08:54.730
H-How am I supposed to tell them apart?

08:58.200 --> 08:59.510
W-Which one is the real...

08:59.510 --> 09:00.670
Isn't it obvious?

09:01.300 --> 09:03.360
The better fighter is, of course.

09:03.910 --> 09:05.370
Who's the better fighter?

09:07.380 --> 09:10.020
[Clear Clouds & Autumn Moon]

09:08.880 --> 09:10.210
This is bad. Really bad.

09:10.410 --> 09:12.490
What if they realize
one of them is Guihong?

09:12.490 --> 09:14.060
Junior General is
an extraordinary fighter.

09:14.060 --> 09:15.320
Don't worry about him.

09:16.480 --> 09:17.290
What a mess.

09:33.330 --> 09:34.340
Chu Guihong?

09:35.390 --> 09:36.920
"Extraordinary fighter"?

09:42.540 --> 09:44.510
H-He's the commander of Qianyu Army!

09:44.510 --> 09:45.910
He came here in
the disguise of Chief Master.

09:45.910 --> 09:47.170
I bet he is up to no good!

09:47.320 --> 09:48.980
General Chu, catch the sword.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.430
Stop!

10:29.000 --> 10:29.790
Yimeng,

10:29.810 --> 10:30.860
are you okay?

10:31.240 --> 10:32.780
I'm perfectly fine.

10:33.060 --> 10:34.390
No matter how this happened,

10:34.390 --> 10:36.650
I can't let them turn against each other.

10:37.910 --> 10:39.360
May I have your attention?

10:39.360 --> 10:40.150
I think

10:40.550 --> 10:42.600
this is just a misunderstanding.

10:43.440 --> 10:45.030
General Chu Guihong

10:45.030 --> 10:46.910
might have been tricked by rumors

10:46.930 --> 10:48.630
and mistaken the Nightwalkers

10:48.630 --> 10:50.120
for a group of

10:50.200 --> 10:52.460
mobsters hiding in the capital.

10:52.630 --> 10:54.900
That's why he disguised
as Mr. Li and came here

10:54.900 --> 10:56.630
What are "mobsters"?

10:56.630 --> 10:57.890
for an investigation.

10:58.030 --> 11:00.030
"Mop holders" for short, I suppose.

11:01.330 --> 11:03.130
This is where we stand now.

11:03.400 --> 11:04.540
M-Miss Song,

11:04.870 --> 11:06.480
this rude guy accused our chief

11:06.480 --> 11:07.840
of stealing Qianyu Army's weapons.

11:07.840 --> 11:09.150
Who are you talking about?

11:09.150 --> 11:10.360
Despicable schemer.

11:10.360 --> 11:10.790
Indeed!

11:10.790 --> 11:12.440
Watch your tongue!

11:17.280 --> 11:19.600
How come I don't know about the theft

11:19.630 --> 11:20.750
of weapons?

11:35.440 --> 11:36.630
I completely understand.

11:36.630 --> 11:37.590
I've got the gist.

11:37.590 --> 11:39.150
Just now, General Chu told me

11:39.150 --> 11:41.030
the whole story.

11:41.030 --> 11:42.680
The theft of weapons is

11:42.870 --> 11:44.510
also a misunderstanding.

11:48.140 --> 11:49.030
Miss Song,

11:49.120 --> 11:49.840
I saw everything.

11:49.840 --> 11:50.960
He didn't utter a word at all.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.790
Shut up!

11:52.200 --> 11:53.630
We're ventriloquists.

11:53.630 --> 11:54.720
What do you know?

11:55.720 --> 11:56.360
Alright.

11:56.790 --> 11:58.590
We've made things clear.

11:58.790 --> 12:01.540
Why not turn hostility into hospitality?

12:01.600 --> 12:02.480
Shake hands and

12:02.600 --> 12:03.930
make friends, will you?

12:04.910 --> 12:05.630
Guys,

12:05.630 --> 12:06.510
let's shake hands

12:06.510 --> 12:07.510
and make friends!

12:22.310 --> 12:24.900
Why are you still standing
here like a cutout?

12:25.270 --> 12:26.630
Make a friendly gesture now

12:26.630 --> 12:27.440
to end this mess

12:27.440 --> 12:28.440
and defuse the tension.

12:28.440 --> 12:29.750
Just get it over with.

12:29.750 --> 12:31.200
I'm so embarrassed.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.030
Mr. Li,

12:44.750 --> 12:45.600
how about

12:45.840 --> 12:47.150
you take the initiative?

12:47.150 --> 12:47.910
Okay?

12:48.240 --> 12:49.080
Please make nice

12:49.080 --> 12:50.330
so I can wrap this up.

12:50.450 --> 12:52.240
Look, everyone is staring at me.

12:52.240 --> 12:53.550
I'm so embarrassed.

12:53.550 --> 12:54.720
What a day.

12:54.720 --> 12:56.490
I'm mortally embarrassed.

12:56.960 --> 12:57.750
Please.

12:57.750 --> 12:59.680
Make a friendly gesture, will you?

13:04.200 --> 13:05.400
This is infuriating.

13:05.790 --> 13:08.020
You two stubborn guys.

13:06.280 --> 13:11.350
[Big Fortune]

13:08.130 --> 13:09.060
Come with me.

13:09.510 --> 13:10.440
How annoying!

13:29.390 --> 13:31.080
The three of us are about to team up

13:31.080 --> 13:32.510
against Nan Heng.

13:32.630 --> 13:34.550
Why are you so hostile to each other?

13:34.550 --> 13:36.480
I didn't agree to partner with him.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.600
A vulgar ruffian.

13:38.630 --> 13:39.850
How self-conceited.

13:41.080 --> 13:43.270
You disturbed
the Nightwalkers without cause.

13:43.270 --> 13:44.800
Don't you owe me an apology?

13:46.860 --> 13:48.430
At least I should know who

13:48.600 --> 13:50.600
I'll apologize to, don't you think?

13:50.670 --> 13:52.270
Why should I tell you who I am?

13:52.510 --> 13:53.320
Alright.

13:53.840 --> 13:54.630
Mr. Li,

13:54.900 --> 13:57.030
please take off your mask
and show him your face

13:57.030 --> 13:58.430
as a gesture of good will.

14:05.510 --> 14:07.440
I got a scar on the face in childhood.

14:07.440 --> 14:08.970
I'd rather keep it covered.

14:10.750 --> 14:11.720
Did you hear that?

14:11.720 --> 14:13.250
He has a solid reason for...

14:13.600 --> 14:15.260
Nan Heng is in the hall as well.

14:15.270 --> 14:17.220
If you agree to go meet him with me...

14:17.220 --> 14:18.550
Today you caused a scene here

14:18.550 --> 14:20.960
just to prove that I have a
connection with Nan Heng?

14:20.960 --> 14:22.600
Mr. Li can't be working for Nan Heng.

14:22.600 --> 14:24.320
He just cursed him with me the other day.

14:24.320 --> 14:25.390
Then, Mr. Li, I'm cordially

14:25.390 --> 14:26.910
inviting you to meet Nan Heng with me,

14:26.910 --> 14:28.120
so you can prove your innocence.

14:28.120 --> 14:29.250
Why should I do that?

14:29.840 --> 14:30.600
Plus,

14:30.600 --> 14:31.390
Nan Heng is a prince.

14:31.390 --> 14:33.450
Offending a prince can lead
to serious consequences.

14:33.450 --> 14:34.840
That makes sense.

14:34.840 --> 14:36.030
Wise civilians know not
to irritate the authorities.

14:36.030 --> 14:37.260
Don't force him, alright?

14:37.260 --> 14:39.720
You keep declining to
prove your innocence.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.000
How about I take you

14:41.000 --> 14:43.240
back to the capital prefecture's office

14:43.240 --> 14:44.080
for an interrogation?

14:44.080 --> 14:44.840
This is enough.

14:44.840 --> 14:45.770
Stop it, you two.

14:45.840 --> 14:47.240
No more bickering, okay?

14:50.110 --> 14:51.710
Let me reiterate this again.

14:51.720 --> 14:53.240
We're gathered here today

14:53.240 --> 14:54.480
to fight against Nan Heng,

14:54.480 --> 14:56.320
not to argue, gentlemen.

15:02.300 --> 15:03.380
You see,

15:03.630 --> 15:06.000
Mr. Li chose not to hold you accountable

15:06.000 --> 15:07.670
for messing up this place.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.840
Why are you still scowling?

15:08.840 --> 15:09.390
I...

15:09.390 --> 15:11.320
So what if you command Qianyu Army?

15:15.750 --> 15:17.050
And you, Mr. Li,

15:17.080 --> 15:18.870
do you think the world
of yourself just because

15:18.870 --> 15:19.960
you rule the Waning River Crescent

15:19.960 --> 15:21.220
and the Nightwalkers?

15:26.080 --> 15:26.670
Fine.

15:26.670 --> 15:28.240
Since you two consider
yourselves no ordinary men,

15:28.240 --> 15:30.360
why not go mess with Nan Heng

15:30.390 --> 15:32.030
who's also here today?

15:32.110 --> 15:34.370
What's the point of fighting each other?

15:49.960 --> 15:50.750
Answer me.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.440
Can we

15:52.720 --> 15:54.390
form an alliance today?

16:01.130 --> 16:01.940
Fine.

16:03.000 --> 16:04.860
You both refuse to join me, right?

16:05.000 --> 16:05.840
I'll do it myself then.

16:05.840 --> 16:06.550
Yimeng!

16:14.510 --> 16:15.570
If you believe him,

16:16.030 --> 16:17.290
then I'll believe him.

16:33.950 --> 16:36.150
Among all the crap Mr. Li has said today,

16:36.240 --> 16:37.550
one thing is correct.

16:37.670 --> 16:39.810
I'm an incompetent man who doesn't

16:39.960 --> 16:42.530
deserve Yimeng's trust and affection.

16:42.750 --> 16:44.440
She has done so much for me.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.460
I must repay her with all my heart.

16:50.360 --> 16:51.790
Nan Heng will stay here till nighttime.

16:51.790 --> 16:52.990
I'll go and stall him.

16:56.960 --> 16:57.980
It means

16:58.000 --> 17:00.130
we're allies now, right?

17:00.200 --> 17:01.000
Chief Master!

17:02.080 --> 17:02.880
Chief Master.

17:07.410 --> 17:09.210
A guest is asking to meet you now.

17:09.210 --> 17:10.540
Please go see him.

17:11.900 --> 17:13.000
Miss Song,

17:13.069 --> 17:14.030
I need to go now.

17:14.200 --> 17:15.030
Make yourself at home.

17:15.030 --> 17:15.960
You go ahead, Mr. Li.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.119
See you later.

17:19.200 --> 17:20.000
Terrific!

17:22.109 --> 17:23.680
Hurry up. Chu Guihong has set off.

17:23.680 --> 17:24.960
I'm working on it.

17:24.960 --> 17:25.589
I...

17:25.720 --> 17:26.960
Easy! Easy!

17:30.240 --> 17:31.110
Why so grumpy?

17:31.110 --> 17:32.750
You're not the only one with a temper.

17:32.750 --> 17:33.550
Hurry.

17:42.550 --> 17:43.850
When this is over,

17:43.880 --> 17:44.960
you should take a break.

17:44.960 --> 17:45.750
Not after

17:45.750 --> 17:47.000
I pick a bone with you.

17:47.000 --> 17:48.800
I'm showing care for you, but...

17:49.830 --> 17:51.440
Please quickly remove me from the position

17:51.440 --> 17:52.070
of Second Master.

17:52.070 --> 17:53.480
I've been wanting to quit.

17:53.480 --> 17:54.310
Stop nagging,

17:54.310 --> 17:55.770
or I'll make you the chief.

17:56.720 --> 17:58.250
Hurry. Go get me my clothes.

18:00.110 --> 18:00.920
Guihong,

18:01.160 --> 18:02.270
you'll partner with Li Shiliu?

18:02.270 --> 18:04.070
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

18:04.070 --> 18:05.160
I didn't.

18:05.680 --> 18:08.680
I still think Li Shiliu is
colluding with Nan Heng.

18:09.510 --> 18:11.820
Then why did you grant
Song Yimeng's request?

18:11.820 --> 18:12.780
This is a setup.

18:13.660 --> 18:15.830
It's like drawing a snake out of its hole.

18:15.830 --> 18:17.560
Drawing a snake out of its hole?

18:19.030 --> 18:19.960
Who's the snake?

18:20.240 --> 18:21.030
Song Yimeng?

18:21.610 --> 18:22.760
A beautiful snake?

18:29.070 --> 18:31.030
Please stop asking, Your Highness.

18:31.030 --> 18:32.830
Wait. Why can't I ask questions?

18:33.440 --> 18:35.970
Given Your Highness's performance today...

18:41.630 --> 18:43.320
The less Your Highness know,

18:43.400 --> 18:44.690
the safer we will be.

18:47.040 --> 18:48.240
Here come the guests.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.900
General Chu, you've put yourself

18:57.900 --> 18:59.300
through so much trouble.

18:59.750 --> 19:00.780
Are you here to

19:01.110 --> 19:02.860
show support for Rui?

19:02.930 --> 19:05.030
The Eighteenth Prince has a gentle soul.

19:05.030 --> 19:06.550
Blessings befall His Highness.

19:06.550 --> 19:08.210
He needs no extra assistance.

19:08.350 --> 19:11.150
How shameless of you
for making that silly remark.

19:11.440 --> 19:12.880
You're pretty cheeky,

19:13.000 --> 19:14.500
General Chu.

19:14.520 --> 19:15.440
Nan Heng!

19:17.010 --> 19:18.130
Gentlemen,

19:18.160 --> 19:20.490
a feast is served. Please enjoy.

19:21.710 --> 19:24.080
[Excellence and Distinction]

19:22.460 --> 19:23.270
Have a seat.

19:33.920 --> 19:35.240
Why not dine with me?

19:36.090 --> 19:38.010
If you're scared of me,

19:38.450 --> 19:39.480
then just leave.

19:40.070 --> 19:41.720
Don't spoil my mood.

19:49.480 --> 19:50.400
I...

20:27.110 --> 20:27.960
What a surprise.

20:27.960 --> 20:30.110
The food here actually tastes

20:30.130 --> 20:32.480
better than that in the palace.

20:43.060 --> 20:44.140
Gentlemen,

20:44.210 --> 20:46.110
how did you like the meal?

20:46.590 --> 20:48.160
There are desserts

20:48.160 --> 20:50.310
and fruit prepared

20:50.310 --> 20:51.510
for you.

20:51.640 --> 20:53.300
They're being presented now.

21:04.920 --> 21:05.910
General Chu,

21:06.110 --> 21:07.270
you're already seated.

21:07.270 --> 21:08.660
Why don't you eat anything?

21:08.660 --> 21:10.130
With a vile person around,

21:10.330 --> 21:11.780
my appetite has been

21:11.920 --> 21:13.050
completely ruined.

21:13.920 --> 21:15.310
I feel the same,

21:16.320 --> 21:18.050
when dining with a vile person.

21:19.750 --> 21:21.450
General Chu, you cleverly

21:21.680 --> 21:23.120
impersonated Li Shiliu

21:23.150 --> 21:24.970
only to find out if I have

21:25.110 --> 21:27.480
any connection with him, right?

21:32.770 --> 21:34.000
So what if I say yes?

21:42.240 --> 21:43.640
I am a royal prince.

21:43.640 --> 21:45.310
How could I possibly be in collusion

21:45.310 --> 21:46.710
with that lowly ruffian?

21:46.920 --> 21:48.470
Don't push me too far.

22:03.930 --> 22:04.960
Sorry. I'm sorry.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.720
You klutz, what's wrong with you?

22:06.720 --> 22:07.590
Get out of here!

22:07.590 --> 22:08.350
Yes.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.310
Gentlemen,

22:12.310 --> 22:13.110
please don't be mad.

22:13.110 --> 22:14.590
I'll bring you a new plate.

22:14.590 --> 22:15.400
No need.

22:16.440 --> 22:18.100
It's a waste of time talking to

22:18.590 --> 22:20.390
those I don't see eye to eye with.

22:20.880 --> 22:21.680
Goodbye.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.300
Did you make it?

22:43.920 --> 22:45.480
Yes. I replaced

22:45.550 --> 22:47.280
that fake knife with a real one.

22:49.520 --> 22:50.320
Hold on.

22:51.200 --> 22:52.070
Don't forget

22:52.160 --> 22:53.960
that someone is waiting for you.

22:57.680 --> 22:58.680
Hurry up! Run!

23:10.590 --> 23:12.200
The whole place was in chaos today.

23:12.200 --> 23:13.260
Whose fault was it?

23:13.350 --> 23:14.280
Mine, I suppose.

23:21.310 --> 23:22.310
It's stuck again.

23:29.310 --> 23:30.110
Let me do it.

23:30.270 --> 23:31.070
I can do it.

24:04.790 --> 24:05.590
Dinner?

24:05.830 --> 24:07.240
I happen to be hungry now.

24:08.560 --> 24:10.020
Oh, right, Mr. Shangguan,

24:10.160 --> 24:11.290
where is your chief?

24:11.440 --> 24:12.640
Why isn't he here yet?

24:13.310 --> 24:14.110
Chief Master,

24:14.720 --> 24:16.320
Miss Song is eager to see you.

24:22.170 --> 24:23.240
Playing the flute, aren't you?

24:23.240 --> 24:24.240
It's just dinner.

24:24.240 --> 24:25.350
Why a fuss?

24:25.830 --> 24:28.200
It's for the best effect.

24:35.070 --> 24:36.670
Alright. All of you, get out.

24:43.920 --> 24:44.720
Mr. Li,

24:45.640 --> 24:46.920
these friends of yours

24:47.000 --> 24:48.200
are so much fun.

24:49.000 --> 24:49.790
They just like

24:49.790 --> 24:51.920
horsing around. I hope you don't mind.

24:52.280 --> 24:53.090
Oh, right.

24:53.480 --> 24:55.350
You haven't opened my gift yet.

24:55.440 --> 24:57.200
Come on. Open it. Take a look.

25:06.400 --> 25:07.200
What...

25:07.200 --> 25:08.730
What bizarre thing is this?

25:09.550 --> 25:10.590
What do you think?

25:12.070 --> 25:13.200
It's cute, isn't it?

25:13.790 --> 25:15.160
I made it myself.

25:17.720 --> 25:19.120
Look,

25:19.240 --> 25:21.900
whether you'll get
involved in politics or not,

25:22.000 --> 25:23.400
I just want to thank you

25:24.350 --> 25:26.270
for saving my life last time.

25:31.000 --> 25:31.930
You're welcome.

25:32.200 --> 25:33.000
Yimeng!

25:35.410 --> 25:36.670
What are you doing here?

25:36.670 --> 25:38.600
Shouldn't you be with Nan Heng now?

25:39.000 --> 25:39.920
He left.

25:40.790 --> 25:41.480
Yimeng,

25:41.500 --> 25:42.400
it's getting late.

25:42.400 --> 25:43.530
Let me take you home.

25:43.660 --> 25:45.110
Dinner was just served.

25:45.110 --> 25:46.110
I haven't eaten it yet.

25:46.110 --> 25:47.510
Your father is waiting for you at home.

25:47.510 --> 25:48.240
Let's go.

25:48.240 --> 25:48.960
But...

25:49.640 --> 25:50.640
Mr. Li,

25:50.790 --> 25:51.720
talk to you later!

25:51.720 --> 25:52.850
I have to go home now.

26:13.160 --> 26:13.960
Wait!

26:16.520 --> 26:18.380
Have you seen the Seventh Prince?

26:20.000 --> 26:20.790
Fugui,

26:20.790 --> 26:21.880
seriously,

26:21.880 --> 26:24.740
aren't you embarrassed to
play with mud at this age?

26:25.060 --> 26:26.720
I wasn't playing with mud.

26:26.750 --> 26:28.240
Someone dropped

26:28.240 --> 26:29.960
a flower pot on my head.

26:32.020 --> 26:33.620
Did you see the prince or not?

26:36.680 --> 26:38.210
I shouldn't have asked you.

26:40.270 --> 26:41.130
Your Highness?

26:42.200 --> 26:43.060
Your Highness!

26:43.340 --> 26:46.660
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

27:00.350 --> 27:02.340
[Humbly requested by
Yao Qian, Zhang Han, et al]

27:02.700 --> 27:04.520
[One hour ago]

27:04.640 --> 27:05.570
What did you say?

27:06.320 --> 27:07.960
The Lantern Festival.

27:11.350 --> 27:12.210
Your Highness,

27:12.990 --> 27:15.060
the Emperor, along with
the Eighteenth Prince,

27:15.060 --> 27:17.170
has planned to appoint
Chu Guihong to manage

27:17.170 --> 27:19.690
all affairs related to
the Lantern Festival

27:19.720 --> 27:21.950
in tomorrow's morning meeting.

27:21.970 --> 27:24.490
It means the Emperor
is intending to let Chu

27:24.520 --> 27:25.820
shoulder the responsibility

27:25.820 --> 27:28.020
of guarding the capital and the palace.

27:29.120 --> 27:31.050
It's really the Lantern Festival.

27:31.960 --> 27:35.860
I can't sleep at night.
I've been working around the clock.

27:35.900 --> 27:37.560
After a thorough study,

27:37.870 --> 27:40.800
I've come up with a plan.

27:41.160 --> 27:43.070
Your Highness, please allow me

27:43.070 --> 27:44.860
to appeal to all censors to file

27:45.310 --> 27:47.910
a joint petition in
tomorrow's meeting to urge

27:48.200 --> 27:49.960
the Emperor to withdraw
the intended appointment.

27:49.960 --> 27:52.440
We will turn the tables

27:53.270 --> 27:55.790
and attack Chu and his minions

27:55.790 --> 27:57.790
till they're completely defeated.

28:00.510 --> 28:01.370
Your Highness.

28:02.920 --> 28:04.160
Your Highness!

28:04.790 --> 28:06.880
If the Lantern Festival proceeds smoothly,

28:06.880 --> 28:08.550
Chu Guihong will receive more

28:08.550 --> 28:10.410
fame and support from the people.

28:10.830 --> 28:13.160
The Emperor might promote him and give him

28:13.550 --> 28:15.550
a chance to lead an army to fight battles

28:15.550 --> 28:16.940
and achieve more.

28:16.960 --> 28:19.400
Then he'll be a strong aide

28:19.400 --> 28:20.720
to the Eighteenth Prince.

28:20.720 --> 28:23.160
They'll probably rise to the top.

28:23.550 --> 28:24.480
If that happens,

28:25.770 --> 28:27.750
it'll be nearly impossible

28:27.750 --> 28:29.350
for Your Highness to achieve

28:29.560 --> 28:30.720
your ambitions...

28:30.720 --> 28:31.830
Enough. I get it.

28:31.830 --> 28:32.400
I...

28:32.400 --> 28:33.730
Without my permission,

28:33.780 --> 28:34.780
no one

28:34.920 --> 28:36.380
can take action.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.000
Yes.

28:48.950 --> 28:50.350
Look,

28:50.550 --> 28:53.270
whether you'll get
involved in politics or not,

28:53.790 --> 28:55.270
I just want to thank you

28:55.720 --> 28:57.800
for saving my life last time.

29:30.350 --> 29:32.350
Officers, if there is no objection,

29:33.070 --> 29:35.830
I hereby affirm that the capital
prefect will be responsible

29:35.830 --> 29:37.830
for managing the Lantern Festival.

29:43.070 --> 29:45.350
Your Majesty, I object to it!

29:55.920 --> 29:58.180
Uncle, why didn't you tell me about this?

29:58.460 --> 30:00.250
Alas!

30:00.400 --> 30:01.950
The Lantern Festival is about

30:01.950 --> 30:05.590
celebration and praying
for the nation's wellbeing.

30:05.830 --> 30:08.260
However, the new
capital prefect, Chu Guihong,

30:08.260 --> 30:09.750
though exonerated, is by no means

30:09.750 --> 30:12.270
a proper candidate for the job.

30:12.790 --> 30:13.810
Now,

30:14.040 --> 30:16.230
the dead warriors haven't rested in peace,

30:16.230 --> 30:18.400
and the borders are still
troubled by refugees.

30:18.400 --> 30:20.830
If such an important job is given to Chu,

30:20.960 --> 30:23.770
there will be serious consequences!

30:24.000 --> 30:26.260
I implore Your Majesty
to withdraw the edict.

30:26.260 --> 30:29.430
We implore Your Majesty
to withdraw the edict!

30:30.200 --> 30:33.030
We implore Your Majesty
to withdraw the edict!

30:48.810 --> 30:50.530
Silence, all of you!

30:49.210 --> 30:51.870
[Calm, Respectful, and Sincere]

30:51.830 --> 30:53.640
Calm, Your Majesty!

30:58.530 --> 30:59.640
The empire...

31:00.680 --> 31:02.720
is not solely owned by me.

31:03.450 --> 31:05.620
But as long as I still hold the throne,

31:06.220 --> 31:09.150
I will not tolerate nonsense in the court!

31:15.400 --> 31:16.680
This is my decision.

31:18.070 --> 31:20.400
The capital prefect,
Chu Guihong, will oversee

31:20.400 --> 31:22.930
all affairs related to
the Lantern Festival.

31:25.000 --> 31:26.310
Censor Yao Qian

31:26.310 --> 31:28.480
distorted the truth with malicious intent.

31:28.480 --> 31:29.240
He will be

31:29.640 --> 31:31.100
caned 20 times and demoted

31:31.370 --> 31:34.430
to be an invocator of
the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

31:38.270 --> 31:39.270
A demotion?

31:40.310 --> 31:41.860
Doesn't Yao Qian

31:42.000 --> 31:43.350
work for Nan Heng?

31:46.030 --> 31:48.290
This is not part of the script, is it?

31:48.310 --> 31:50.790
Is the male lead's power
really being weakened?

31:50.790 --> 31:53.240
Has the story started to change?

31:53.350 --> 31:55.790
Will the ending be different?

31:55.810 --> 31:56.900
The Emperor

31:56.920 --> 32:00.020
is determined to weaken
Nan Heng's power in the capital.

32:00.020 --> 32:01.880
Nan Heng has had enough good days.

32:01.930 --> 32:03.460
It's time for his collapse.

32:09.750 --> 32:10.910
Before long,

32:11.400 --> 32:13.680
the Eighteenth Prince will rightfully

32:13.790 --> 32:15.190
become the crown prince.

32:23.240 --> 32:24.030
Yimeng,

32:25.740 --> 32:28.120
I've been busy with
military affairs these years,

32:28.120 --> 32:29.380
so I've neglected you.

32:30.070 --> 32:31.930
I didn't realize until yesterday

32:32.570 --> 32:34.230
that you care so much about me.

32:39.460 --> 32:41.120
You like the south, don't you?

32:41.440 --> 32:42.680
When the whole thing is over,

32:42.680 --> 32:44.100
shall we move there?

32:48.000 --> 32:49.100
If...

32:50.960 --> 32:52.020
If you are

32:52.830 --> 32:55.760
given a chance to extricate
yourself from politics,

32:55.830 --> 32:57.830
will you drop everything and leave?

33:01.510 --> 33:02.310
Yimeng,

33:03.280 --> 33:04.280
you know me well.

33:05.620 --> 33:06.550
Qianyu Army...

33:07.830 --> 33:08.640
You told me

33:09.350 --> 33:11.810
you'd hate to see anyone
around you get hurt.

33:11.880 --> 33:13.340
But that's bound to happen

33:13.400 --> 33:15.600
unless you're relieved from your post.

33:18.840 --> 33:20.440
Why are you bringing this up?

33:24.830 --> 33:26.750
Yesterday, Mr. Li asked me

33:27.570 --> 33:29.250
about my view of Nan Heng.

33:30.830 --> 33:32.320
This is what I've been thinking.

33:32.320 --> 33:33.740
It's true that Nan Heng

33:34.160 --> 33:35.480
is a ruthless man

33:35.500 --> 33:37.360
with a mind full of conspiracies.

33:37.680 --> 33:38.920
But maybe...

33:40.350 --> 33:42.550
There's a chance to turn things around.

33:44.480 --> 33:46.070
My Lady! My Lady!

33:46.070 --> 33:46.880
Mr. Chu.

33:47.200 --> 33:48.510
Bad news!

33:53.790 --> 33:55.240
Bear with it.

33:58.030 --> 34:00.270
Alright, it's done.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.210
Rong Hua.

34:04.590 --> 34:05.400
You...

34:06.020 --> 34:07.510
Shouldn't you be catching bandits?

34:07.510 --> 34:08.570
Who did this to you?

34:08.880 --> 34:09.670
General Chu,

34:10.230 --> 34:11.300
the bandits

34:11.500 --> 34:13.190
lured us to an abandoned mine

34:13.190 --> 34:14.880
situated ten miles outside the city.

34:14.880 --> 34:16.280
Before we could see them,

34:17.510 --> 34:19.110
they detonated explosives,

34:20.850 --> 34:22.560
which injured our people.

34:23.110 --> 34:23.960
Which mine?

34:24.280 --> 34:25.980
The one in the western suburbs.

34:25.980 --> 34:27.750
Where Yao Qian was ditched?

34:28.230 --> 34:29.030
Yes.

34:29.920 --> 34:31.920
Nan Heng is trying to intimidate me.

34:34.310 --> 34:35.290
Easy, easy.

34:35.630 --> 34:36.440
Yimeng,

34:37.060 --> 34:38.520
do you still think there is

34:38.889 --> 34:40.620
a chance to turn things around?

34:41.330 --> 34:42.120
This time,

34:42.469 --> 34:43.880
we must think of a new way

34:43.909 --> 34:44.830
to stop him.

34:52.400 --> 34:53.480
Please don't hurt me, sir!

34:53.480 --> 34:55.320
I'm just a lowly eunuch.

34:55.320 --> 34:56.920
I really don't know anything!

34:56.920 --> 34:59.380
An officer of the Censorate
was caned today.

34:59.460 --> 35:01.520
You executed the punishment, right?

35:02.360 --> 35:04.250
Someone instructed you to aim for

35:04.310 --> 35:05.960
the most fragile body parts.

35:06.070 --> 35:07.230
You would receive

35:07.360 --> 35:09.070
handsome rewards if you could maim him

35:09.070 --> 35:10.550
with those 20 times of caning.

35:10.550 --> 35:11.360
Is it correct?

35:11.360 --> 35:12.110
I...

35:12.630 --> 35:13.110
I...

35:13.150 --> 35:13.960
Confess!

35:13.960 --> 35:15.150
Who instructed you?

35:15.150 --> 35:16.410
What proof do you have?

35:18.070 --> 35:19.030
Bad news.

35:19.050 --> 35:20.140
Miss Song is here.

35:27.480 --> 35:28.710
Is your chief around?

35:28.710 --> 35:30.440
This way, Miss Song.

35:32.710 --> 35:34.150
Yunlong, clean up this place.

35:34.150 --> 35:35.880
Shanhu, destroy the evidence.

35:35.880 --> 35:36.740
The rest of you,

35:36.880 --> 35:37.920
stall the enemy.

35:38.000 --> 35:38.800
-Yes!
-Yes!

35:43.030 --> 35:44.070
This way.

35:45.480 --> 35:46.410
Are you alright?

35:55.880 --> 35:56.670
Miss Song,

35:56.710 --> 35:57.360
take that path.

35:57.360 --> 35:58.510
Okay. Let's go.

36:13.400 --> 36:15.800
"I see a well by the river."

36:15.960 --> 36:18.150
"A dark mouth I discover."

36:18.150 --> 36:19.880
-Brilliant!
-Nice verses!

36:19.880 --> 36:21.790
I'm so flattered.

36:21.840 --> 36:22.800
Mr. Li.

36:25.000 --> 36:25.880
Miss Song,

36:25.960 --> 36:27.160
you came just in time.

36:27.590 --> 36:29.880
Chief is composing poems
and playing chess with us

36:29.880 --> 36:31.190
to nurture our minds.

36:32.840 --> 36:33.550
Mr. Shangguan,

36:33.550 --> 36:35.670
pardon me for the intrusion.

36:35.670 --> 36:37.470
I need a word with your chief now.

36:42.840 --> 36:43.850
What's so serious

36:43.960 --> 36:46.020
that you have to talk to me in private?

36:46.230 --> 36:48.110
It's a matter of life or death.

36:48.190 --> 36:49.190
If anything slips,

36:49.190 --> 36:50.960
best case—we lose some blood;

36:51.110 --> 36:53.310
worst case—
our families get executed.

36:53.960 --> 36:55.020
That serious?

36:57.360 --> 36:58.160
Spill it then.

36:58.920 --> 36:59.710
Mr. Li,

36:59.960 --> 37:01.150
do you dare to…

37:03.840 --> 37:05.100
C-Could you bend over?

37:10.790 --> 37:11.920
Second Master,

37:12.000 --> 37:13.320
are they kissing?

37:13.360 --> 37:15.480
What are they talking about?

37:15.630 --> 37:17.630
What can a man and a woman talk about?

37:17.710 --> 37:19.230
They must be flirting

37:19.230 --> 37:20.440
and giggling.

37:20.670 --> 37:22.730
You think they're planning a murder?

37:24.770 --> 37:26.130
Killing Nan Heng?

37:28.480 --> 37:29.390
Me?

37:30.440 --> 37:31.230
No way!

37:31.670 --> 37:33.660
I haven't agreed to fight him yet,

37:33.800 --> 37:35.070
let alone kill him.

37:35.320 --> 37:37.070
That's why I'm asking you

37:37.190 --> 37:38.710
what I can do to have your consent.

37:38.710 --> 37:40.170
I will never consent to it!

37:43.150 --> 37:44.230
If you have a death wish,

37:44.230 --> 37:44.920
go and indulge yourself.

37:44.920 --> 37:45.980
Don't drag me down.

37:48.280 --> 37:49.280
Mr. Li, wait!

37:51.280 --> 37:52.710
Though he denies he likes Miss Song,

37:52.710 --> 37:54.280
he did stop when she told him to.

37:54.280 --> 37:55.070
Mr. Li,

37:55.590 --> 37:57.120
didn't you ask me why I chose

37:57.190 --> 37:58.670
to believe Chu Guihong

37:58.760 --> 37:59.840
and not Nan Heng?

38:00.190 --> 38:01.400
Mr. Li, you know what?

38:01.510 --> 38:02.920
Nan Heng had his people blow up a mine

38:02.920 --> 38:04.190
and ambush Qianyu Army.

38:04.190 --> 38:05.360
Any misstep in the process

38:05.360 --> 38:07.600
could kill or injure
many innocent civilians.

38:07.600 --> 38:08.890
We have to stop him now,

38:09.000 --> 38:10.760
or there will be more disasters.

38:10.760 --> 38:12.000
Blowing up a mine?

38:12.480 --> 38:13.960
Rong Hua saw it himself.

38:14.150 --> 38:16.150
Many Qianyu soldiers were injured.

38:18.880 --> 38:20.440
Have you done a fact check?

38:21.190 --> 38:22.190
Motive.

38:22.440 --> 38:23.190
Method.

38:23.230 --> 38:24.150
Eyewitnesses...

38:24.150 --> 38:25.150
It all checks out.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.760
What else do I need?

38:29.770 --> 38:30.480
I see.

38:32.750 --> 38:33.750
I understand now.

38:35.000 --> 38:36.000
Every

38:36.070 --> 38:37.000
bad deed

38:37.030 --> 38:38.510
must be done by Nan Heng.

38:38.550 --> 38:39.360
If a wench

38:39.360 --> 38:41.130
in the east loses an egg,

38:41.230 --> 38:42.830
it must be stolen by Nan Heng.

38:42.880 --> 38:43.840
If a widower

38:44.070 --> 38:45.930
in the west gets drunk and fights,

38:46.800 --> 38:48.230
it must be related to Nan Heng.

38:48.230 --> 38:49.030
Is that right?

38:50.190 --> 38:52.450
Who knows if he's innocent or not?

38:54.110 --> 38:55.760
His house is not far from

38:56.070 --> 38:57.210
the west of the city.

38:57.510 --> 38:58.760
As for the east...

38:59.070 --> 39:00.510
Maybe he takes a stroll there

39:00.510 --> 39:01.960
every now and then.

39:02.440 --> 39:03.880
Who knows what

39:03.920 --> 39:05.340
sneaky stuff or severe crimes

39:05.340 --> 39:06.840
he does every day?

39:11.280 --> 39:12.070
Mr. Li,

39:12.710 --> 39:13.660
actually...

39:14.280 --> 39:15.840
Just like you, I used

39:16.110 --> 39:17.360
to think none of

39:17.880 --> 39:19.190
these things

39:19.800 --> 39:21.030
could be true,

39:21.710 --> 39:23.800
and that all I had to do was stop Nan Heng

39:23.800 --> 39:25.480
and protect myself.

39:26.960 --> 39:28.690
But my mind changed on the night

39:29.190 --> 39:30.190
when that dancer

39:31.190 --> 39:33.120
nearly lost her life because of me.

39:36.670 --> 39:38.000
That wasn't your fault.

39:40.630 --> 39:41.710
But her life was

39:41.730 --> 39:43.520
endangered because of me.

39:44.480 --> 39:45.590
I ignorantly thought

39:45.590 --> 39:46.920
I could change the story

39:47.110 --> 39:48.480
and the world.

39:49.140 --> 39:50.800
That dancer, Rong Hua and some others

39:50.800 --> 39:52.400
got hurt for the same reason.

39:53.320 --> 39:54.350
If I hadn't

39:54.680 --> 39:56.880
interfered with the storyline,

39:58.550 --> 39:59.800
maybe none of those

40:00.080 --> 40:02.170
could have happened, right?

40:06.960 --> 40:07.840
That said,

40:07.840 --> 40:09.590
I've set off on this path already.

40:09.590 --> 40:11.150
I can't give up halfway.

40:14.590 --> 40:15.280
Mr. Li,

40:15.280 --> 40:16.230
maybe some of my words

40:16.230 --> 40:18.070
have bewildered you,

40:19.510 --> 40:21.000
but I'm just trying to get

40:21.000 --> 40:22.110
my meaning across.

40:23.130 --> 40:25.480
I understand all your concerns.

40:26.670 --> 40:27.480
Indeed,

40:27.510 --> 40:28.960
I'm selfishly attempting

40:28.960 --> 40:30.000
to use you

40:30.360 --> 40:31.920
to eliminate Nan Heng.

40:35.620 --> 40:36.570
If...

40:38.510 --> 40:39.580
If

40:40.220 --> 40:41.990
you really hate to do that...

40:43.400 --> 40:43.960
I'm not entirely...

40:43.960 --> 40:45.960
I'll report you to the authorities.

40:47.420 --> 40:48.590
I'll hand over the evidence

40:48.590 --> 40:49.880
of you committing human trafficking

40:49.880 --> 40:51.280
to my father and Chu Guihong.

40:51.280 --> 40:52.920
Then all your hard work in these years

40:52.920 --> 40:54.400
will go down the drain.

40:54.400 --> 40:55.670
But that was an accident!

40:55.670 --> 40:56.670
I don't care.

40:56.840 --> 40:57.760
It happened in

40:57.760 --> 40:59.400
the Waning River Crescent's Hall.

40:59.400 --> 41:00.860
You'll all be held liable.

41:03.000 --> 41:03.720
Oh, you...

41:07.320 --> 41:09.920
You're such a fickle woman.
